# ============================================================
# .gitignore 示例（供参考，非强制）
#
# 用法：如需启用，复制成 .gitignore 即可，再按你的项目情况增删：
#     cp .gitignore.example .gitignore
#
# 主要用来忽略编译产物，避免把它们误提交到参赛仓。
# 其他类型（编辑器临时文件、缓存、本地密钥等）可按需自行添加。
#
# 注意：logs/ 下最终导出的 AI Coding 日志必须提交，不要忽略！
# ============================================================

# Build artifacts
build/
out/
*.o
*.a
*.elf
*.hex
*.map

# NuttX in-tree application dependency artefacts
app/*/.built
app/*/.depend
app/*/Make.dep
demos/*/.built
demos/*/.depend
demos/*/Make.dep
packages/*/.built
packages/*/.depend
packages/*/Make.dep
docs/开发计划/ESP32-P4竞赛参考差异对照.md

# Local ESP-Hosted station credentials; never commit this configuration.
board/esp32p4/esp32p4-function-ev-board/configs/*_local/

# ============================================================
# Local toolchain staging (not committed)
# ============================================================
# ESP32-P4 builds that enable CONFIG_ESP32P4_ESPRESSIF_TOOLCHAIN need the
# Espressif riscv32-esp-elf toolchain.  It is staged under prebuilts/ for
# local use only: it is ~430 MB of binaries after trimming, which must not
# enter the contest repository.
#
# Create it with scripts/setup_toolchain.sh (see docs/开发日志/编译/
# ESP32-P4X-乐鑫工具链S0-S3接入记录.md).  The directory is ignored as a
# whole; only the README that documents the expected layout is committed.
prebuilts/*
!prebuilts/README.md
